sequenceDiagram
    participant Orch as FMS Guardrails Orchestrator<br/>(or other client)
    participant Det as regex-detector<br/>8080/TCP HTTP (no TLS)
    participant Logs as Container stdout
    participant Kubelet as kubelet / probe

    Note over Orch,Det: Flow 1 — Text contents detection (no encryption, no auth)
    Orch->>Det: POST /api/v1/text/contents<br/>8080/TCP HTTP, Auth: none<br/>{contents: [str], detector_params: {regex: [str]}}
    Det->>Logs: INFO "incoming payload" (full text, incl. PII)
    alt regex list empty
        Det-->>Orch: 400 "empty regex"
    else
        loop each content string × each pattern
            alt pattern is ssn / credit-card / email
                Det->>Det: Built-in PII regex (compiled per request)
            else custom pattern
                Det->>Det: Compile + match custom regex
                Note right of Det: Invalid regex → warn! log only,<br/>pattern silently skipped
            end
        end
        Det-->>Orch: 200 JSON [[detections]]<br/>start, end, text, detection_type,<br/>detection, score=1.0<br/>(flattened, not grouped per content)
    end

    Note over Kubelet,Det: Flow 2 — Health check
    Kubelet->>Det: GET /health<br/>8080/TCP HTTP, Auth: none
    Det-->>Kubelet: 200 "healthy"
